    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d123">

                <pb facs="0167" n="151" xml:id="pg151"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">831.00/1–449: Circular telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Diplomatic
                        Representatives in the American Republics, Except Cuba and Venezuela </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-01-04">January 4,
                        1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Embassy Habana reports that prior to leaving Habana Jan 3 for visit in Miami
                    Gallegos told press he had received from State Dept completely satisfactory
                    explanation activities US in Caracas.</p>
                <p>Gallegos by this act has publicly confirmed what he stated privately some time
                    ago, namely his recognition that charges of US involvement in Venez coup are
                    completely false.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
